# Examples:
#   ZIR-123: Add user authentication feature
#   ZIR-456: Fix memory leak in connection pool
#   ZIR-789: Update API documentation
#
# You can add additional details on subsequent lines after a blank line:
#
# ZIR-123: Add user authentication feature
